WEBVTT

00:00:02.440 --> 00:00:06.650
<b>GUNDAM
VICTORY
MOBILE SUIT</b>

00:00:06.650 --> 00:00:12.610
The furious rain, Makes my heart shake
hageshii ame ga, kokoro wo yuruwaseru

00:00:12.610 --> 00:00:15.820
Like it did on that day
Ano hi no youni

00:00:17.780 --> 00:00:22.910
But I just ran through, In my dream I had till yesterday
Tada hashirinuketa, kinou made no MY DREAM

00:00:23.500 --> 00:00:26.710
...I still believe
...shinjiteiru no sa

00:00:29.550 --> 00:00:34.470
I'm willing to fight, An endless defense
Owari no nai, defense demo ii yo

00:00:35.090 --> 00:00:42.350
As long as you, Keep on gazing at me
Kimi ga boku wo, mitsumetsuzukete kureru nara

00:00:42.730 --> 00:00:45.270
STAND UP TO THE VICTORY!

00:00:45.600 --> 00:00:50.980
Turn to face all the mornings ahead, And someday
Ikutsumono asa wo mukae, Itsuka kitto

00:00:52.070 --> 00:00:53.860
Try to seize them
tsukande miseru

00:00:53.990 --> 00:00:56.450
STAND UP TO THE VICTORY!

00:00:56.780 --> 00:01:02.120
Even if nothing, Lies on the other side
Sono mukougawa ni, nanimonakutemo

00:01:03.200 --> 00:01:06.040
It doesn't matter to me
kamawanai kara

00:01:06.210 --> 00:01:14.050
...Just as long as I can embrace, Your gentle, irreplaceable smile!
Kakegae no nai, kimi no yasashii egao daite

00:01:26.460 --> 00:01:31.800
While headed for the Hiland, the Reineforce was jumped by a BESPA fleet.

00:01:32.130 --> 00:01:35.760
Üso and Marbet rushed to aid them.

00:01:37.100 --> 00:01:42.760
It was there that Üso first experienced the terror of group combat in space.

00:01:49.660 --> 00:01:52.800
SEARCH FOR SHAHKTI

00:01:52.800 --> 00:01:55.360
"Search for Shahkti".
SEARCH FOR SHAHKTI

00:02:24.900 --> 00:02:26.960
Thank goodness we didn't take a direct hit.

00:02:27.600 --> 00:02:28.600
What's that?

00:02:30.760 --> 00:02:32.030
A baby bottle?

00:02:32.160 --> 00:02:33.330
What's up?

00:02:35.960 --> 00:02:39.100
It's hair. It looks like dog's hair, doesn't it?

00:02:39.200 --> 00:02:40.760
Could it be Flanders'?

00:02:41.600 --> 00:02:45.560
Does this mean Shahkti and Karlmann were in this room?

00:02:48.700 --> 00:02:49.900
Don't cry.

00:02:53.500 --> 00:02:56.030
There are life signs. Four normal suits.

00:02:56.060 --> 00:02:57.260
Approach them.

00:02:58.700 --> 00:02:59.800
Karl?

00:03:12.700 --> 00:03:15.300
It's a dog! What's a dog doing out here?

00:03:18.830 --> 00:03:20.000
What's going on?

00:03:20.030 --> 00:03:21.730
There are kids and a baby here.

00:03:21.830 --> 00:03:23.900
They're in Federation Forces normal suits.

00:03:24.160 --> 00:03:25.860
A dog and kids?

00:03:25.900 --> 00:03:27.760
They might be kids from the Hiland.

00:03:27.800 --> 00:03:29.030
Recover them!

00:03:29.060 --> 00:03:29.730
Yes, sir.

00:03:31.100 --> 00:03:33.460
Don't cry. I'll wipe your nose in a sec.

00:03:40.660 --> 00:03:42.060
Lieutenant Gomez!

00:03:42.160 --> 00:03:43.900
What is it, Mr. Jahannam?

00:03:44.730 --> 00:03:48.960
Is it true they're turning Keilas Guilie into a giant beam cannon?!

00:03:49.000 --> 00:03:51.330
Probably to strike the Earth directly.

00:03:51.600 --> 00:03:55.500
Then we need to hit them while they're still docking!

00:03:55.860 --> 00:03:57.600
Haven't we tried fleet attacks...

00:03:57.630 --> 00:04:00.330
...against the Keilas Guilie Fleet a couple of times already?

00:04:00.360 --> 00:04:04.860
If we attack them now, all the space colonies will ally with us!

00:04:04.900 --> 00:04:09.430
Mr. Jahannam, don't talk like the resistance did back in Uwig.

00:04:10.100 --> 00:04:13.360
The longer we wait, the worse our situation gets, Lieutenant Gomez!

00:04:13.400 --> 00:04:15.830
You do have a point.

00:04:17.230 --> 00:04:19.800
I can't believe he's the hero of the League Militaire!

00:04:19.830 --> 00:04:20.800
Üso.

00:04:21.460 --> 00:04:22.560
What is it?

00:04:22.600 --> 00:04:24.960
Where do you think they found this baby bottle?

00:04:25.300 --> 00:04:26.700
A baby bottle on a military ship?

00:04:26.730 --> 00:04:28.660
It looks like Shahkti and the others were here.

00:04:39.260 --> 00:04:40.500
These are...

00:04:47.500 --> 00:04:50.100
Shahkti's willowherb seeds.

00:04:51.530 --> 00:04:54.430
Üso, what are you going to do? Wait!

00:04:58.600 --> 00:05:02.430
If you aren't from the Hiland, how did you end up out here?

00:05:02.860 --> 00:05:05.500
We... We flew here from Earth.

00:05:05.530 --> 00:05:07.160
Hey, make them some milk!

00:05:07.200 --> 00:05:08.300
Yes, sir!

00:05:08.860 --> 00:05:11.560
Just put it in like that. Right. Thanks.

00:05:11.860 --> 00:05:13.730
Odelo! Warren!

00:05:14.430 --> 00:05:17.300
Shahkti and Suzy were aboard the Reineforce!

00:05:17.330 --> 00:05:18.200
Suzy?!

00:05:18.230 --> 00:05:19.500
And Shahkti?

00:05:19.860 --> 00:05:21.900
But now, they're nowhere to be found!

00:05:21.930 --> 00:05:23.860
But you just said they were aboard!

00:05:23.900 --> 00:05:25.100
What's wrong?

00:05:25.400 --> 00:05:29.500
Mr. Oliver and Shrike Team have searched the entire ship for them, but...

00:05:29.530 --> 00:05:31.730
That means we have to look outside of the ship!

00:05:31.760 --> 00:05:33.100
Look for who?

00:05:33.330 --> 00:05:34.400
Tomáš...

00:05:34.830 --> 00:05:37.230
Two younger girls, a baby, and a dog.

00:05:37.330 --> 00:05:39.030
They're a little weird, but...

00:05:39.160 --> 00:05:40.360
They aren't weird!

00:05:40.730 --> 00:05:43.100
I'll get the Reineforce to move on this!

00:05:43.130 --> 00:05:44.960
There's no way they will!

00:05:45.000 --> 00:05:51.460
Could you lend me that little rocket you named the Fishbone?

00:05:51.830 --> 00:05:52.700
What do you think?

00:05:52.730 --> 00:05:54.160
He can take it out, but...

00:05:54.200 --> 00:05:57.530
They were thrown out of the ship during the battle, right?

00:05:57.560 --> 00:06:00.830
Yeah, but maybe they managed to survive.

00:06:01.460 --> 00:06:03.030
Please think it over.

00:06:03.060 --> 00:06:05.500
I'm going to ask Mr. Jinn Jahannam.

00:06:06.530 --> 00:06:09.700
We can't help losing some people in war!

00:06:09.730 --> 00:06:14.230
And recklessly going out there may increase the victims on our side!

00:06:14.260 --> 00:06:16.500
Just because they're ordinary civilian children?!

00:06:16.530 --> 00:06:19.600
Mr. Jahannam is right. Just let it go.

00:06:20.230 --> 00:06:21.400
Understood.

00:06:21.430 --> 00:06:22.400
Let's go!

00:06:22.430 --> 00:06:23.060
Right.

00:06:23.730 --> 00:06:26.130
You have to face the realities of the battlefield.

00:06:26.260 --> 00:06:27.330
I know.

00:06:27.360 --> 00:06:28.500
Üso!

00:06:53.530 --> 00:06:54.730
Voiceprint...

00:06:55.400 --> 00:06:56.430
Fingerprints...

00:06:57.130 --> 00:06:58.330
Retinal scan...

00:06:58.660 --> 00:07:02.560
...and blood analysis. It all syncs with our data.

00:07:02.660 --> 00:07:04.060
Whose data, though?

00:07:04.960 --> 00:07:07.730
With Queen Maria Armonia's.

00:07:08.100 --> 00:07:09.400
What are you saying?

00:07:09.430 --> 00:07:13.160
That this girl, Shahkti Kareen, is Queen Maria's daughter?!

00:07:13.300 --> 00:07:14.230
Yes, sir.

00:07:14.600 --> 00:07:18.630
The queen is unmarried and has excellent psychic abilities.

00:07:19.560 --> 00:07:23.900
So, she and I share a karmic connection. She's my niece...

00:07:24.530 --> 00:07:28.100
Tell no one else of this! It's liable to cause chaos!

00:07:28.500 --> 00:07:31.930
Karel, head forward and hide near Reineforce's bow.

00:07:31.960 --> 00:07:32.960
Roger! Roger!

00:07:35.760 --> 00:07:38.730
Martina and Elisha, you move when Odelo and the others signal.

00:07:38.760 --> 00:07:40.330
Okay, Tomáš! Okay, Tomáš!

00:07:48.100 --> 00:07:53.100
Shahkti Kareen, you say you came from Earth in search of your mother?

00:07:53.600 --> 00:07:54.700
Yes.

00:07:56.330 --> 00:07:58.060
We know your identity.

00:08:04.060 --> 00:08:07.660
Your mother is the great leader of Zanscare.

00:08:07.700 --> 00:08:11.460
We have discovered that you're Cronicle Asher's niece.

00:08:16.260 --> 00:08:18.660
What do you mean?

00:08:19.960 --> 00:08:25.730
Meeting in this way must be destined by your bloodline, Cronicle.

00:08:30.660 --> 00:08:34.700
I sincerely apologize for you having been left to grow up on your own.

00:08:36.060 --> 00:08:38.500
This is a lie. It must be!

00:08:39.360 --> 00:08:41.200
It's true, Shahkti Kareen!

00:08:41.960 --> 00:08:44.130
You're a child, so it's difficult to explain...

00:08:44.160 --> 00:08:46.800
...the circumstances of your disappearance.

00:08:48.430 --> 00:08:51.330
The only mother I know is the one I had in Kasarelia!

00:08:55.730 --> 00:08:59.060
There's no need for you to understand immediately, Shahkti.

00:09:08.900 --> 00:09:11.660
He's aiming to take it at lunch time. Smart.

00:09:11.700 --> 00:09:15.300
If he didn't have good sense, he wouldn't be a good pilot.

00:09:16.330 --> 00:09:17.860
We need to be ready to give him backup.

00:09:17.900 --> 00:09:19.330
I'll call Junko and the others.

00:09:19.360 --> 00:09:20.600
R-Right.

00:09:26.400 --> 00:09:27.260
Huh?

00:09:27.830 --> 00:09:29.360
Aren't those the kids from the Hiland?

00:09:39.960 --> 00:09:41.260
Nice timing.

00:09:42.000 --> 00:09:44.030
You okay? What's up?

00:09:44.060 --> 00:09:45.860
Sorry to bother you.

00:09:45.900 --> 00:09:47.300
We're testing it.

00:09:50.460 --> 00:09:52.230
They're taking the Zoloat, too!

00:09:52.260 --> 00:09:53.830
Who's piloting it?

00:09:54.360 --> 00:09:56.800
You're going to Side 2 in this thing?

00:09:57.100 --> 00:09:59.300
We'll make it, even if it is handmade.

00:09:59.830 --> 00:10:01.100
See you later!

00:10:05.430 --> 00:10:06.660
We've gotta hurry.

00:10:06.700 --> 00:10:09.260
Junko, it's Oliver. Get down here.

00:10:17.630 --> 00:10:19.900
That was great, everyone. We did it.

00:10:30.400 --> 00:10:33.230
Wasn't this where the Reineforce was fighting before?

00:10:33.560 --> 00:10:35.760
Okay, let's send out a monitor eye.

00:10:35.860 --> 00:10:39.530
Elisha, have Odelo and Warren exit the ship and look from there.

00:10:41.260 --> 00:10:43.030
Odelo, if you'd be so kind.

00:10:43.060 --> 00:10:44.960
Sure thing. I'm on it!

00:10:45.400 --> 00:10:47.730
Pay attention to all 360 degrees, please.

00:10:47.760 --> 00:10:48.630
Of course!

00:10:48.660 --> 00:10:49.900
Be careful.

00:10:50.430 --> 00:10:52.460
Thanks, Martina! Ow!

00:10:57.560 --> 00:11:01.030
So, that Tomáš kid even took your Zoloat?

00:11:01.060 --> 00:11:02.400
That's right.

00:11:02.700 --> 00:11:07.060
Well, I also would've just let them go. Right, Commander?

00:11:07.460 --> 00:11:10.660
We need to respect the feelings of the Victory's main pilot.

00:11:10.900 --> 00:11:14.300
Roger. I'll back them up as best I can.

00:11:15.100 --> 00:11:16.430
Jeez...

00:11:16.460 --> 00:11:19.300
The Earth's keeping me from seeing anything!

00:11:22.400 --> 00:11:24.460
Üso, the way you're flying,

00:11:24.500 --> 00:11:26.930
you're going to get pulled into Earth's gravity well.

00:11:27.160 --> 00:11:28.100
Be careful.

00:11:28.260 --> 00:11:31.500
Right, and if I get pulled in, that's it for me.

00:11:34.160 --> 00:11:35.700
I need to search carefully.

00:11:40.560 --> 00:11:42.160
Üso doesn't seem to understand.

00:11:42.200 --> 00:11:44.400
Because he's looking for a girl he considers his little sister.

00:11:44.430 --> 00:11:44.930
What?!

00:11:45.000 --> 00:11:46.430
It's not reading as a friendly!

00:11:47.830 --> 00:11:50.000
Their ID signal shows them as BESPA units!

00:11:50.030 --> 00:11:53.700
Üso! You've got incoming units forward-high of the V Gundam!

00:11:53.730 --> 00:11:55.400
What? From the front?

00:11:55.800 --> 00:11:57.260
I have them on radar!

00:11:57.930 --> 00:12:01.460
My head's not in the game! It's gonna get me killed!

00:12:16.160 --> 00:12:18.900
Odelo, Warren, get back to the Aeneas at once!

00:12:18.930 --> 00:12:20.500
We've got unknowns approaching!

00:12:21.800 --> 00:12:23.630
BESPA ships?

00:12:24.600 --> 00:12:27.460
Miss Elisha, is it a BESPA warship?

00:12:27.600 --> 00:12:29.160
Huh? It looks like it?

00:12:40.900 --> 00:12:44.630
Possible mobile suit activity. Proceed with caution.

00:12:49.330 --> 00:12:51.930
Why'd BESPA have to show up now?!

00:12:52.300 --> 00:12:56.900
We'll never explain Tomáš's Zoloat and the Fishbone!

00:13:02.530 --> 00:13:03.660
Two units.

00:13:04.460 --> 00:13:07.500
I dragged them all into this. What'll I do?

00:13:10.000 --> 00:13:12.830
Strange, I don't see them making any moves.

00:13:13.330 --> 00:13:15.800
Then let's try maximum magnification.

00:13:18.960 --> 00:13:20.300
Are you kidding me?!

00:13:20.600 --> 00:13:23.500
Captain Aralcand, I need an ID, fast!

00:13:23.630 --> 00:13:27.360
Do we have a Sinope and a Zoloat in this airspace?!

00:13:27.830 --> 00:13:31.600
They're not responding to our hails. The frequencies have been changed.

00:13:31.630 --> 00:13:34.300
Are those the ones that were captured by the League Militaire?

00:13:34.330 --> 00:13:35.860
Are they adrift?

00:13:36.500 --> 00:13:40.060
Investigate, but stay alert. If they attack, destroy them!

00:13:44.000 --> 00:13:45.930
How can I help Martina?

00:13:45.960 --> 00:13:47.960
That's a good question.

00:13:48.330 --> 00:13:51.130
It's the man's duty to protect the woman!

00:13:54.900 --> 00:13:56.060
Miss Elisha...

00:13:56.900 --> 00:14:00.130
If only I had a mobile suit, like Üso does!

00:14:01.100 --> 00:14:03.200
Odelo, what are you doing? Odelo!

00:14:03.830 --> 00:14:06.100
Miss Elisha, get back to the Hiland!

00:14:06.130 --> 00:14:08.330
It's neutral territory!

00:14:08.600 --> 00:14:10.530
What about you, Odelo? Odelo!

00:14:11.530 --> 00:14:13.200
Roger, reversing course!

00:14:13.230 --> 00:14:14.230
Was that Tomáš?

00:14:14.260 --> 00:14:15.230
Yeah.

00:14:15.460 --> 00:14:17.300
Come back, Odelo!

00:14:17.330 --> 00:14:19.560
We need to protect Martina and Elisha!

00:14:20.130 --> 00:14:22.530
You protect them there!

00:14:27.230 --> 00:14:28.200
Who's there?!

00:14:28.230 --> 00:14:30.200
This thing has missiles, right?

00:14:31.400 --> 00:14:32.860
What are you going to do?

00:14:32.900 --> 00:14:35.100
We can't just sit here waiting to get shot!

00:14:35.130 --> 00:14:38.860
We can't fire first! My brother told us that!

00:14:40.360 --> 00:14:41.460
Understood!

00:14:45.230 --> 00:14:46.400
Okay...

00:14:46.800 --> 00:14:47.930
Odelo!

00:14:50.060 --> 00:14:53.630
Üso, don't scatter any Minovsky particles! Got that?

00:14:54.600 --> 00:14:59.160
Understood. That'll make them think we want to fight them, right?

00:14:59.700 --> 00:15:00.630
But...

00:15:06.100 --> 00:15:09.800
Right. This is all we can do for now.

00:15:09.830 --> 00:15:12.130
Odelo! Please, don't do this!

00:15:13.700 --> 00:15:15.760
They're just begging those guys to come here!

00:15:18.260 --> 00:15:19.300
Get away!

00:15:21.930 --> 00:15:23.130
The Fishbone?!

00:15:23.160 --> 00:15:24.760
It wasn't me! It was Odelo!

00:15:24.800 --> 00:15:26.630
He who strikes first, wins, Üso!

00:15:27.900 --> 00:15:29.060
Karel! Elisha!

00:15:29.100 --> 00:15:31.600
Use the balloons to confuse them! Take evasive action!

00:15:32.530 --> 00:15:33.630
On it!

00:15:44.800 --> 00:15:47.000
Scattering Minovsky particles!

00:15:47.030 --> 00:15:48.360
We have no choice.

00:15:49.000 --> 00:15:51.560
We'll bet on how you do. Go get them!

00:15:59.100 --> 00:16:02.430
The unknowns have taken hostile action!

00:16:05.730 --> 00:16:08.930
We don't want to fight you! Stop, please!

00:16:09.560 --> 00:16:11.160
Odelo, no!

00:16:12.030 --> 00:16:13.700
Elisha! Tell me what to do!

00:16:13.730 --> 00:16:15.630
Odelo's acting like he's high!

00:16:16.130 --> 00:16:19.760
Karel! The Fishbone must have missile launchers onboard!

00:16:19.800 --> 00:16:22.460
Turn around! I'll fire them!

00:16:23.330 --> 00:16:25.630
That's right, we can fight back!

00:16:27.800 --> 00:16:29.530
Why won't you understand?

00:16:30.700 --> 00:16:33.630
I have to find Shahkti and protect everyone!

00:16:33.960 --> 00:16:35.630
Only I can do it!

00:16:38.700 --> 00:16:40.260
Another Zoloat-type...

00:16:40.900 --> 00:16:43.830
I'll save and protect everyone all by myself!

00:16:59.300 --> 00:17:02.330
Have we found the missing Sinope 321?

00:17:02.500 --> 00:17:05.530
They said it was captured by the League Militaire.

00:17:05.560 --> 00:17:09.830
BESPA of the Zanscare Empire... They're still soft.

00:17:14.230 --> 00:17:17.100
Tomáš! Don't keep shooting! You'll be targeted!

00:17:22.530 --> 00:17:24.130
It'll take more than that!

00:17:24.160 --> 00:17:26.960
Are these the Zoloat's wire beams?!

00:17:27.000 --> 00:17:29.530
Then a wire beam for a wire beam!

00:17:37.400 --> 00:17:38.530
They got away!

00:17:38.560 --> 00:17:41.360
The Aeneas and the Fishbone will be captured!

00:17:46.400 --> 00:17:49.130
Here they come! We can still use this!

00:17:49.160 --> 00:17:51.230
That's the 321, all right!

00:17:52.030 --> 00:17:54.330
Dammit, these dummies are in the way!

00:17:56.030 --> 00:17:57.300
Fire! Fire!

00:18:01.560 --> 00:18:02.830
Can't we go faster?

00:18:02.860 --> 00:18:03.700
This is full thrust!

00:18:03.730 --> 00:18:05.560
We need to zigzag away from them more!

00:18:05.600 --> 00:18:08.300
I know! We should be able to use the fuel tanks!

00:18:14.760 --> 00:18:17.000
Please, just leave us alone!

00:18:17.030 --> 00:18:18.130
What?!

00:18:22.760 --> 00:18:25.760
On the other side of the stars, hoshi no mukou ni
Soap bubbles! Bubbles!

00:18:25.760 --> 00:18:27.600
Look, a doggie!

00:18:27.630 --> 00:18:29.160
Who? Who is that?

00:18:29.200 --> 00:18:30.860
there lies the future mirai ga aru to
Shahkti and Flanders.

00:18:30.860 --> 00:18:33.960
there lies the future mirai ga aru to

00:18:34.000 --> 00:18:35.760
The young ones... wakamonotachi wa

00:18:35.760 --> 00:18:37.430
You!

00:18:37.430 --> 00:18:39.930
The young ones... wakamonotachi wa

00:18:39.960 --> 00:18:45.200
...spread their wings of dreams yume no tsubasa wo hirogete

00:18:45.230 --> 00:18:48.400
If you don't know when to quit, I'll shoot you, too!

00:18:48.430 --> 00:18:53.730
As they scatter the red poppy blossoms... hinageshi no hana wo chirashi nagara

00:18:53.730 --> 00:18:55.930
It's too late for me to surrender, now!

00:18:55.930 --> 00:18:59.260
As they scatter the red poppy blossoms... hinageshi no hana wo chirashi nagara

00:18:59.560 --> 00:19:00.360
Cronicle,

00:19:00.400 --> 00:19:02.730
Would you take Shahkti back...
Setting out on their journey tabidatte iku

00:19:02.730 --> 00:19:02.760
Setting out on their journey tabidatte iku

00:19:02.760 --> 00:19:05.760
...to the Zanscare homeland?

00:19:05.760 --> 00:19:05.800
Setting out on their journey tabidatte iku

00:19:05.800 --> 00:19:07.230
The homeland?

00:19:07.260 --> 00:19:10.730
Not before we complete Keilas Guilie's Earth mop-up operation.

00:19:10.760 --> 00:19:14.330
We can spare you while we're still subjugating the solar battery.

00:19:14.360 --> 00:19:16.200
There's nothing wrong with taking...

00:19:16.230 --> 00:19:19.260
...the princess back to see your sister, is there?

00:19:19.800 --> 00:19:21.630
I'll inform Shahkti Kareen.

00:19:21.660 --> 00:19:23.030
Please do.

00:19:23.060 --> 00:19:23.960
Sir!

00:19:25.060 --> 00:19:28.600
It seems I was too hasty in my conquest of Earth.

00:19:29.860 --> 00:19:31.000
Tomáš!

00:19:34.830 --> 00:19:36.960
I get you! I'll try it, Üso!

00:19:36.960 --> 00:19:38.360
Take this!

00:19:43.630 --> 00:19:45.400
What?! The shield!

00:19:47.430 --> 00:19:48.660
W-What the...

00:19:51.960 --> 00:19:54.630
I-Impossible! Dammit!

00:19:56.400 --> 00:19:57.700
Just go!

00:20:06.300 --> 00:20:08.560
I'm no match for them!

00:20:15.430 --> 00:20:17.200
The Shrike Team is here!

00:20:17.230 --> 00:20:18.430
We're saved?!

00:20:18.860 --> 00:20:22.000
Mr. Oliver! Miss Marbet! Miss Junko! I love you!

00:20:22.230 --> 00:20:25.900
Miss Marbet and the others understood what we were doing.

00:20:25.930 --> 00:20:27.660
So, that's the sort of people they are.

00:20:27.700 --> 00:20:28.500
Yeah.

00:20:32.760 --> 00:20:35.730
Lay down covering fire and moor the mobile suits.

00:20:35.760 --> 00:20:36.430
Sir!

00:20:51.500 --> 00:20:54.730
If you were soldiers, I'd have you court-martialed!

00:20:54.760 --> 00:20:57.000
Saying you're sorry isn't going to cut it on this!

00:20:57.030 --> 00:20:59.130
Captain Gomez, they need to be...

00:20:59.160 --> 00:21:01.730
...thrown into solitary confinement or something!

00:21:01.930 --> 00:21:04.060
H-Hold on a second, please!

00:21:04.100 --> 00:21:06.500
They're valuable fighters on our staff.

00:21:06.700 --> 00:21:09.160
Please, let us handle this.

00:21:09.200 --> 00:21:11.800
Even the League Militaire requires military discipline!

00:21:11.830 --> 00:21:14.530
No, we'll let the pilots handle their people.

00:21:14.730 --> 00:21:17.200
Come on, you've apologized. That's enough.

00:21:17.730 --> 00:21:18.130
Right.

00:21:18.160 --> 00:21:21.330
It's okay. I'm sure Shahkti's all right.

00:21:21.630 --> 00:21:23.930
She's probably playing with Suzy and Karlmann, right?

00:21:23.960 --> 00:21:24.830
Right.

00:21:25.430 --> 00:21:29.760
Of course! We can use the Hiland's microwaves as a cannon!

00:21:29.800 --> 00:21:31.800
We can consider that in our strategy.

00:21:32.000 --> 00:21:34.630
That guy sure impresses himself, huh?

00:21:35.230 --> 00:21:38.360
And then we can destroy Keilas Guilie!

00:21:39.630 --> 00:21:43.200
That's right! If Shahkti and Suzy are alive,

00:21:43.230 --> 00:21:47.130
they might have been picked up by the Keilas Guilie Fleet.

00:22:01.760 --> 00:22:05.100
I can't believe this warship will be used to attack Earth.

00:22:24.060 --> 00:22:29.530
Piercing the sky, Blue lightning
sora wo tsukisasu aoi inazuma

00:22:29.530 --> 00:22:35.320
Staining the earth, With the shadow of greed
daichi o someteku, yokubou no kage

00:22:36.370 --> 00:22:41.460
Once again, when the nightmare, Envelops the Earth
futatabi akumu ga, sekai wo tsutsumu toki

00:22:41.460 --> 00:22:46.790
You hear voices crying out "S.O.S."
"SOS" wo sakebu koe ga kikoeru...

00:22:48.630 --> 00:22:54.130
Let proud hope fill your heart
hokoritakaki kibou wo mune ni

00:22:54.720 --> 00:23:03.100
And stand up! Say a prayer for peace!!
tachiagare! heiwa no inori komete!

00:23:04.100 --> 00:23:05.100
WINNERS FOREVER!

00:23:06.100 --> 00:23:08.980
In every age
itsuno jidai mo

00:23:08.980 --> 00:23:14.570
...People take risks for freedom
hito wa jiyuu wo kakete

00:23:15.000 --> 00:23:17.000
WINNERS FOREVER!

00:23:18.330 --> 00:23:21.240
The battle goes on
tatakai tsuzukeru

00:23:21.240 --> 00:23:25.920
Fighting all alone in solitude
kodoku na made ni hitori...

00:23:34.000 --> 00:23:36.700
Before the attack on Keilas Guilie,

00:23:36.730 --> 00:23:42.530
Üso, Miss Marbet, and Miss Junko must become of one mind.

00:23:43.360 --> 00:23:47.500
As long as they hold on to their hangups, and fight as individuals,

00:23:47.530 --> 00:23:50.860
the battlefield will only be a scene of chaos.

00:23:51.960 --> 00:23:54.230
Next time, on Mobile Suit Victory Gundam:

00:23:54.260 --> 00:23:57.260
Next Episode EVE OF THE DECISIVE BATTLE
"Eve of the Decisive Battle".

00:23:57.260 --> 00:23:58.500
Please watch it!

00:23:58.500 --> 00:24:00.200
Next Episode EVE OF THE DECISIVE BATTLE
